  <main id="main">
    <section class="draw-hero draw-width" aria-labelledby="draw-title">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker kicker-blue">September at Jones General Store</p>
        <img class="vehicle-accent" src="/assets/images/jgs-vehicle-detailing.svg" alt="" width="144" height="68">
        <h1 id="draw-title">A fresh ride.<br><span>A little<br>local love.</span></h1>
        <p class="draw-intro">We’re celebrating with a chance to win an <strong>interior &amp; exterior detailing package</strong> plus a <strong>JGS gift basket.</strong></p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="#details">How to enter</a><a class="button button-secondary" href="#prize">See the prize</a></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="draw-poster"><a href="/assets/images/jgs-september-draw-charlotte.png" aria-label="View the September draw poster at full size"><img src="/assets/images/jgs-september-draw-charlotte.png" alt="Jones General Store: We’re Celebrating! A chance to win interior and exterior vehicle detailing plus a gift basket. Fuel up to receive a ballot during September; draw October 1 live on Facebook." width="1530" height="1980"></a><figcaption>Keeping it local and supporting our community!<br><a href="/assets/documents/jgs-september-draw-charlotte.pdf" download>Download the poster (PDF)</a></figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="draw-dates draw-width" aria-label="Draw schedule">
      <div><span>Entries open</span><strong><time datetime="2026-09-01T09:00:00-04:00">September 1 · 9 AM</time></strong></div>
      <div><span>Entries close</span><strong><time datetime="2026-09-30T22:00:00-04:00">September 30 · 10 PM</time></strong></div>
      <div><span>Facebook Live draw</span><strong><time datetime="2026-10-01T09:30:00-04:00">October 1 · 9:30 AM</time></strong></div>
    </section>
    <p class="draw-width draw-timezone">All dates are in 2026. All times are local to Sagamok (Eastern Time).</p>
    <section class="draw-width draw-section" id="prize" aria-labelledby="prize-title">
      <p class="kicker kicker-blue">Two local favourites</p><h2 id="prize-title">Good for your ride.<br>Goodies for you.</h2>
      <div class="draw-prizes">
        <article class="draw-prize detailing"><p class="prize-label">The Essential Detail Package</p><h3>A fresh clean,<br>inside &amp; out.</h3><p>Interior and exterior vehicle detailing from <strong>Ashton’s Top Notch Mobile Wash &amp; Detailing.</strong></p><p class="draw-value"><strong>$200 value</strong> · 2–3 hours</p><ul class="draw-inclusions"><li><strong>Interior:</strong> Full vacuum, all surfaces wiped and cleaned, windows cleaned, finished with a fresh scent spray.</li><li><strong>Exterior:</strong> Hand wash of the entire exterior, wheels and tires cleaned by hand, and tire shine for a clean, fresh look.</li></ul><p>No vehicle restrictions. Additional charges may apply for vehicles requiring extra cleaning due to excessive dirt or buildup.</p></article>
        <article class="draw-prize gift"><p class="prize-label">The JGS gift basket</p><h3>A little basket.<br>A lot of local love.</h3><p>A gift basket of goodies from <strong>Jones General Store.</strong></p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="draw-info" id="details" aria-labelledby="details-title"><div class="draw-width draw-info-grid">
      <div><p class="kicker kicker-blue">September 1–30, 2026</p><h2 id="details-title">Fuel up.<br>Fill out a ballot.</h2><ol class="draw-entry-steps"><li><strong>Purchase fuel at Jones General Store.</strong> Regular, diesel, premium and midgrade fuel purchases qualify. Any fuel amount gets you one ballot.</li><li><strong>Get your ballot from the cashier.</strong> Fill it out and place it in the collection bin.</li><li><strong>Watch the draw on Facebook Live.</strong> Join the JGS Facebook page on October 1, 2026 at 9:30 AM.</li></ol><p>Entries begin September 1 at 9 AM and end September 30 at 10 PM. Fuel purchases only.</p><p>Ballots are collected in store. This page does not collect entries.</p></div>
      <div class="draw-visit"><h3>Questions? Get in touch.</h3><p>Jones General Store<br>4027 Espaniel Street<br>Sagamok Anishnawbek</p><p><strong>Open daily, 9 AM–10 PM</strong></p><a class="button button-primary" href="tel:+17058651633">Call (705) 865-1633</a><a class="draw-facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/jones.general.store.sagamok/">Visit the JGS Facebook page <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    </div></section>
